r,content_writer_ar,social_media_manager}', '{videographer,video_editor,media_buyer}', NULL, NULL, 'ar', '{"bio": "Social media content for restaurants and cafés in Amman: photography, Reels and account management.", "name": "Nakhla Studio", "about": "A content studio in Amman specialising in restaurants and cafés since 2019. We shoot on location, write in your audience''s own dialect and run your accounts every day, with a clear monthly report. We work with restaurants in Jordan, Saudi Arabia and the UAE.", "strengths": ["Restaurant Reels that bring in orders", "Professional food photography on location", "Daily handling of comments and messages", "A monthly report in numbers"]}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"kind": "tiktok", "value": "nakhla_studio"}, {"kind": "youtube", "value": "nakhla_studio"}]') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
